              "description": "Normalized distribution over concrete per-head price bands (<\u00a315, \u00a315-30, \u00a330-50, \u00a350+). A distribution, not a mode: it preserves bimodal spend (cheap weeknights, occasional blowouts) that a point value would flatten. Cluster C2.",
